  "title": "Chai-Spiced Shortbread Cookies",
  "description": "These chai-spiced shortbread cookies are meant to taste like a chai tea latte. You can play with the spices and amounts, but don&#39;t omit the cardamom.",
  "authors": [
    "Leiland"
  ],
